{"id":1020501,"chapter_id":1020501,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"梦里是一片烟雾朦胧，看不清边界。","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"content":"唯有一方热源在渐渐地朝你靠近，它驱散着周围灰蒙蒙的雾气，让一切变得明亮又清晰。","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"content":"绊倒海伦娜","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"……","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501005,"trial_step":5},{"step":5,"speaker":"？？？","content":"……","voice":["vo_trial_20501_1_6"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501006,"trial_step":6},{"step":6,"content":"睁开眼，梦里的“热源”此时正趴在你的床头，由上至下地盯着你。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501007,"trial_step":7},{"step":7,"content":"见你醒来，她咧嘴一笑，晃了晃脑袋，顿时火星乱飞。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501008,"trial_step":8},{"step":8,"content":"你眼疾手快，抄走床头的文件，塞进了书桌旁的金属文件柜里。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501009,"trial_step":9},{"step":9,"speaker":"选项","options":["打招呼"],"style":6,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501010,"trial_step":10,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"打招呼","goto":11}]},{"step":10,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"早上好，曜。","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501011,"trial_step":11},{"step":11,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"我说过的吧，进别人房间之前，要先敲门才行哦。","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501012,"trial_step":12},{"step":12,"speaker":"曜？","content":"唔……","voice":["vo_trial_20501_1_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501013,"trial_step":13},{"step":13,"content":"小家伙背着手，噘着嘴皱着眉头，一脸的不服气。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501014,"trial_step":14},{"step":14,"content":"仿佛是在说“我也没进‘别人’的房间啊”。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501015,"trial_step":15},{"step":15,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"哎……","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501016,"trial_step":16},{"step":16,"content":"你无奈，牵着曜坐在了书桌前，把她抱在自己腿上，任由她捏着笔在草稿纸上乱画——那叠草稿纸，是随着杜若的一封信一起寄来的。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501017,"trial_step":17},{"step":17,"content":"曜的事件告一段落后，烟烟费了不少力气，才终于找到新生的曜。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501018,"trial_step":18},{"step":18,"content":"她一直陷在昏睡中，生长极为缓慢，你接到通讯后，立刻带人赶往烟烟所在的地方，本着试试的态度，你用枷锁与她相连，没想到曜竟然因此醒了过来。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501019,"trial_step":19},{"step":19,"content":"曜一睁眼，便黏着你不放，你也正好将她带回了管理局。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501020,"trial_step":20},{"step":20,"content":"思忖再三，你给远方的杜若也发去了信息。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501021,"trial_step":21},{"step":21,"content":"杜若收到后，第一时间便给你打来了电话。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501022,"trial_step":22},{"step":22,"speaker":"杜若","content":"我想，应该不需要我特别提醒吧，局长。","voice":["vo_trial_20501_1_23"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":11,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501023,"trial_step":23},{"step":23,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"……","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501024,"trial_step":24},{"step":24,"speaker":"杜若","content":"您太宠她了。","voice":["vo_trial_20501_1_25"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":11,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501025,"trial_step":25},{"step":25,"content":"杜若指了指趴在你脑袋上昏昏欲睡的小娃娃。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501026,"trial_step":26},{"step":26,"content":"她似乎保留着作为“金乌”的鸟类习性，喜欢坐在你的肩膀上，依靠着你的头发安睡。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501027,"trial_step":27},{"step":27,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"她……还小。","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501028,"trial_step":28},{"step":28,"speaker":"杜若","content":"您说的对，但她不只是“还小”。","voice":["vo_trial_20501_1_29"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":11,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501029,"trial_step":29},{"step":29,"speaker":"杜若","content":"真正的曜七年之前就已经死去了，局长。","voice":["vo_trial_20501_1_30"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":11,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501030,"trial_step":30},{"step":30,"speaker":"杜若","content":"现在依赖着您的，是一个全新诞生的……姑且称她为“人”吧。","voice":["vo_trial_20501_1_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":11,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501031,"trial_step":31},{"step":31,"speaker":"杜若","content":"她……不再是您记忆里的那个“曜”了。","voice":["vo_trial_20501_1_32"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":11,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501032,"trial_step":32},{"step":32,"content":"杜若的话一针见血，但你却无法反驳。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501033,"trial_step":33},{"step":33,"content":"可必须有人说出来，必须有人提醒你。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501034,"trial_step":34},{"step":34,"speaker":"选项","options":["我知道的"],"voice":["vo_trial_20501_1_35"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":6,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501035,"trial_step":35,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"我知道的","goto":36}]},{"step":35,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"就算她的体内是新的灵魂，甚至她说不定就是一个新的生命形态……","voice":["vo_trial_20501_1_36"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501036,"trial_step":36},{"step":36,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"但既然她已经重生，我愿意赌一个关于她的结局——我相信自己的能力，能控制住可能出现的风险。","voice":["vo_trial_20501_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501037,"trial_step":37},{"step":37,"content":"你想起她在深林里睁开眼，第一次看向你时，她的眼睛深处，有着你难以忽视的澄澈清透。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501038,"trial_step":38},{"step":38,"content":"聊了许久，趴在你头顶的人像是醒了，砸吧了两下嘴巴，伸了个懒腰，发尾羽尾的火星子乱飞落在了你的手背上。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501039,"trial_step":39},{"step":39,"content":"微微有点烫，但留不下痕迹。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501040,"trial_step":40},{"step":40,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"我会看管好她的，让她能够安心成长，我也会对所有人负责，不会让她……成为威胁大家安全的存在。","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501041,"trial_step":41},{"step":41,"speaker":"曜","content":"局……？","voice":["vo_trial_20501_1_42"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501042,"trial_step":42},{"step":42,"content":"小小鸟扑扇着自己的右手，拍打着你的手臂，把你从回忆里拉出来。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501043,"trial_step":43},{"step":43,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"已经画完了？","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501044,"trial_step":44},{"step":44,"speaker":"曜","content":"嗯~！好啦！","voice":["vo_trial_20501_1_45"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501045,"trial_step":45},{"step":45,"content":"你拿过那叠杜若寄来的信纸，上面用你的红色钢笔，画满了太阳。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501046,"trial_step":46},{"step":46,"content":"简单的红线勾勒出一个圆，和周围四散的光芒。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501047,"trial_step":47},{"step":47,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"真好看，画得真好。","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501048,"trial_step":48},{"step":48,"content":"听到你的夸奖，小鸟用头轻轻蹭着你的手臂，往你的手掌下面钻去。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501049,"trial_step":49},{"step":49,"content":"你顺势摸了摸她的头发，看着她眯着眼睛，高兴地一下一下点头。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501050,"trial_step":50},{"step":50,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"来吧，该去吃早饭了，你一定是偷溜出来的吧？","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501051,"trial_step":51},{"step":51,"speaker":"曜","content":"不想……","voice":["vo_trial_20501_1_52"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501052,"trial_step":52},{"step":52,"content":"曜似乎并不想走出你的房间，你上前去牵起她的手，声音愈发柔和。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501053,"trial_step":53},{"step":53,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"没事的，我会陪你一起去的。","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501054,"trial_step":54},{"step":54,"content":"你牵着曜，往食堂走去。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501055,"trial_step":55},{"step":55,"content":"起先，人们看着曜身上的羽毛和时不时冒出来的火星，都不太愿意接近这位曾经的<color=#fb9259>使徒</color>。","style":3,"background":66,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501056,"trial_step":56},{"step":56,"content":"后来看见和你在一起时，曜总是非常温顺，这让有些胆子大的，开始愿意靠近你们。","style":3,"background":66,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501057,"trial_step":57},{"step":57,"speaker":"工作人员A","content":"要尝尝吗？","voice":["vo_trial_20501_1_58"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":66,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501058,"trial_step":58},{"step":58,"content":"看见人接近，曜飞速地躲到了你的身后，抓着你的裤腿皱着眉，盯着工作人员，发出不明的声音。","style":3,"background":66,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501059,"trial_step":59},{"step":59,"speaker":"曜","content":"呼……","voice":["vo_trial_20501_1_60"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":66,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501060,"trial_step":60},{"step":60,"speaker":"工作人员A","content":"别怕，很好吃的，是水果味的。","voice":["vo_trial_20501_1_61"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":66,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501061,"trial_step":61},{"step":61,"content":"曜抬起头来，看了看你，见你没有对这个拿着糖的人露出防备，便小心地挪出来，歪了歪头，一口叼走了工作人员手里的糖。","style":3,"background":66,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501062,"trial_step":62},{"step":62,"speaker":"曜","content":"啊呜，唔……","voice":["vo_trial_20501_1_63"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":66,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501063,"trial_step":63},{"step":63,"content":"曜的眼睛一下子瞪大了，眯着眼睛又开始点点头，末了从口袋里摸出一朵有点蔫的小花，放在了工作人员手中。","style":3,"background":66,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501064,"trial_step":64},{"step":64,"speaker":"工作人员A","content":"哇，谢谢你的花！","voice":["vo_trial_20501_1_65"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":66,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501065,"trial_step":65},{"step":65,"content":"工作人员站起身来，炫耀似的朝你晃了晃那朵花。","style":3,"background":66,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501066,"trial_step":66},{"step":66,"speaker":"工作人员A","content":"虽然被使徒吞噬过，但听说以前是个广受爱戴的<color=#fb9259>巫祭</color>啊，那果然还是心怀善良的嘛。","voice":["vo_trial_20501_1_67"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":66,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501067,"trial_step":67},{"step":67,"speaker":"工作人员A","content":"局长，她现在这么乖，说不定多带带，就能恢复记忆，变回以前那个温柔的人呢？","voice":["vo_trial_20501_1_68"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":66,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501068,"trial_step":68},{"step":68,"content":"眼前的人再次看向曜，笑着问她。","style":3,"background":66,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501069,"trial_step":69},{"step":69,"speaker":"工作人员A","content":"怎么样，你现在能想起以前的记忆吗？想变回以前的自己吗？","voice":["vo_trial_20501_1_70"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":66,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501070,"trial_step":70},{"step":70,"content":"可曜砸吧了两下嘴里的糖，默默地又回到了你的身后，把头埋进了你的外套里，轻轻地摇了摇。","style":3,"background":66,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501071,"trial_step":71},{"step":71,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"或许吧，但不管怎么说，只要有枷锁在，我就能保证金乌残留在她体内的污染不再发作。","style":2,"background":66,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501072,"trial_step":72},{"step":72,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"至于别的……不管她想不想得起来，我都希望她这一世能摆脱天灾和狂厄的困扰，过得幸福。","style":2,"background":66,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501073,"trial_step":73},{"step":73,"content":"你将曜抱起来，让她趴在你的肩膀上。","style":3,"background":66,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501074,"trial_step":74},{"step":74,"content":"她顺势舒展身子和羽毛时，迸发出点点星火。","style":3,"background":66,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501075,"trial_step":75},{"step":75,"content":"旁的人被火星碰到，笑着说这下可沾了巫祭大人的光了。","style":3,"background":66,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501076,"trial_step":76},{"step":76,"content":"但曜抓着自己的衣角，往怀里掖了一下，靠在你怀里，不再出声。","style":3,"background":66,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501077,"trial_step":77},{"step":77,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"别怕，没事的，我会保护你，保护大家。","style":2,"background":66,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501078,"trial_step":78},{"step":78,"content":"曜几乎时时刻刻都要黏在你身边，依赖着你。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501079,"trial_step":79},{"step":79,"content":"但不知出于何种原因，曜的成长比一般人类孩子快很多。黑环研究院对此非常警觉，隔三差五带走检查，还要在曜的房间增加监视。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501080,"trial_step":80},{"step":80,"content":"你依稀记得，那些仪器似乎是针对灰烬使徒而使用的。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501081,"trial_step":81},{"step":81,"speaker":"黑环研究院","content":"那可是从灰烬使徒中诞生的东西，她长大后到底是变成人，还是变成“金乌”……局长能给出肯定的回答吗？","voice":["vo_trial_20501_1_82"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501082,"trial_step":82},{"step":82,"content":"即便如此，她还是总能从口袋里拿出一朵小花，或是一块亮晶晶的物品，递给那些对她展露笑容的人。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501083,"trial_step":83},{"step":83,"speaker":"曜","content":"这个给你……别怕。","voice":["vo_trial_20501_1_84"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501084,"trial_step":84},{"step":84,"content":"基于此，你也略显放心，接受了上面委派至砂海调查的长期出差。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501085,"trial_step":85},{"step":85,"content":"尽管离开的时候，曜显得有些不安，但砂海的异常让你必须前往。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501086,"trial_step":86},{"step":86,"content":"这段时间砂海所监测的灰烬之潮数值总是偏高，甚至到达临界值。你与士兵们日夜巡查，可是并没有发现灰烬使徒或别的痕迹。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501087,"trial_step":87},{"step":87,"content":"正当你们感到疑点重重，思考是不是其他什么地方出现了灰烬使徒时，管理局里发生了意外。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501088,"trial_step":88},{"step":88,"speaker":"警报声","content":"检测到高M值禁闭者正在突破防线！检测到高M值禁闭者正在突破防线！","voice":["vo_trial_20501_1_90"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501090,"trial_step":90},{"step":89,"speaker":"警报声","content":"请防护人员立即到位，请防护人员立即到位！","voice":["vo_trial_20501_1_91"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501091,"trial_step":91},{"step":90,"content":"接到紧急通讯，你立即从砂海返回，回到管理局时，里面已经乱成了一锅粥。","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501092,"trial_step":92},{"step":91,"content":"一踏进管理局，你明显感到温度急速上升。","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501093,"trial_step":93},{"step":92,"content":"而在事件的中心，骚乱的罪魁祸首，正张开着自己所有的翎羽，匍匐在地上，龇着牙齿，宛若受惊的小兽。",