后，松了口气。曜终于安静了下来，不再受惊乱动，周围的人也暂时放心下来。","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501114,"trial_step":114},{"step":193,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"好了，没事了，我会处理好……","style":2,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501115,"trial_step":115},{"step":194,"speaker":"警报声","content":"请注意！！砂海范围内出现灰烬之潮！！程度严重！！请注意！！砂海范围内出现灰烬之潮！！程度严重！！请立刻行动！！","voice":["vo_trial_20501_1_124"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501116,"trial_step":116},{"step":195,"content":"你正想为曜找补些什么，以安抚大家，却没成想，管理局内发出严重<color=#fb9259>灰烬之潮</color>警报。","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501117,"trial_step":117},{"step":196,"content":"你们是第一次接到这样严重的警报，说明该灰烬之潮距离狄斯城非常近！！","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501118,"trial_step":118},{"step":197,"content":"人群瞬间炸锅，所有相关人员立刻奔回了自己的工作岗位上，开始紧急救援行动。","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501119,"trial_step":119},{"step":198,"content":"而剩下的人，都将目光集中在了刚刚暴走，身上甚至还残留着火焰的曜身上。","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501120,"trial_step":120},{"step":199,"content":"——这位曾经的<color=#dg1f1f>灰烬使徒<i>。","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501121,"trial_step":121},{"step":200,"speaker":"安保人员","content":"局长，我们认为禁闭者曜目前十分危险！！需要……","voice":["vo_trial_20501_1_130"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501122,"trial_step":122},{"step":201,"speaker":"选项","options":["我知道。"],"style":6,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501123,"trial_step":123,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"我知道。","goto":124}]},{"step":202,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"我这次去砂海就是为了调查灰烬之潮相关的事情。","style":2,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501124,"trial_step":124},{"step":203,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"目前能告诉各位的消息是，我们并没有在砂海发现灰烬之潮发生的迹象。","style":2,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120501125,"trial_step":125},{"step":204,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"至于是不是曜引起的，或者说，这次的灰烬之潮是否与她有关。","style":2,"background":107,"log_type":1,"s